WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.531
This is the companion.

00:00:01.531 --> 00:00:09.253
A side panel that sits beside any preview site, so anyone on the team can change the product in plain words, and nothing ships unmeasured.

00:00:09.253 --> 00:00:11.716
Here is how to install it, and what it does.

00:00:12.565 --> 00:00:13.928
Installing takes a minute.

00:00:13.928 --> 00:00:17.494
On the Playbook's Companion page, download the package and unzip it.

00:00:17.494 --> 00:00:19.801
It makes a folder called playbook-extension.

00:00:21.416 --> 00:00:23.751
Open the extensions page in Edge or Chrome.

00:00:23.751 --> 00:00:27.389
Turn on Developer mode, choose Load unpacked, and pick that folder.

00:00:27.389 --> 00:00:28.583
The companion appears.

00:00:28.583 --> 00:00:33.850
It is loaded this way because it is not in a store, and it asks for access to preview sites only.

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:38.689
Open a preview, click the icon, and the panel reads the page it is beside.

00:00:38.689 --> 00:00:41.840
Five groups: Look, Change, Decide, Bring in, and Carry.

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:47.053
Every button says how far it reaches: reads, tries here, or writes a version everyone sees.

00:00:47.053 --> 00:00:47.969
It holds no key.

00:00:47.969 --> 00:00:52.266
Every action goes through the preview's own service, with your own sign-in.

00:00:53.116 --> 00:00:53.349
Look.

00:00:53.349 --> 00:01:00.352
Critique the screen measures it against the visual rules, right here, with the same checks the build runs, so the panel and the build cannot disagree.

00:01:01.967 --> 00:01:02.284
Change.

00:01:02.284 --> 00:01:03.735
Say what you want in a sentence.

00:01:03.735 --> 00:01:06.137
It is tried on this page first, and nothing is saved.

00:01:06.137 --> 00:01:09.490
Then Make current, and it is a version with your name on it, for everyone.

00:01:14.818 --> 00:01:15.173
Decide.

00:01:15.173 --> 00:01:18.620
The gate shows the seven numbers the build measured against the bar.

00:01:18.620 --> 00:01:19.938
Below it, nothing deploys.

00:01:19.938 --> 00:01:24.196
That is the whole loop: test it here, sign it off, and it ships when the gate holds.

00:01:25.045 --> 00:01:27.566
Anyone can fix the site, and nothing ships unmeasured.

00:01:27.566 --> 00:01:30.740
Download it from the Companion page, and open it beside any preview.
